        "title": "Describing Tourist Destinations in Indonesia",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Descriptive texts paint a word picture of specific places, objects, or living creatures. The identification section introduces the specific tourist destination being described to the reader. Subsequent descriptive paragraphs elaborate on specific features, attractions, and environmental conditions.",
